        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;---\ntitle: Bank ABC Mobile Banking - Phase 1 Data Flow Diagram\n---\nflowchart LR\n    subgraph U[Trust Boundary: Customer Device]\n        User[Bank Customer]\n        App[Mobile Banking App]\n    end\n\n    subgraph E[Trust Boundary: Bank Edge]\n        Gateway[API Gateway]\n    end\n\n    subgraph M[Trust Boundary: Banking Microservices]\n        Auth[Authentication Service]\n        Balance[Balance Service]\n        Transfer[Funds Transfer Service]\n    end\n\n    subgraph D[Trust Boundary: Authentication Data]\n        LoginDB[(Mobile Login Database)]\n    end\n\n    subgraph C[Trust Boundary: Core Banking]\n        Core[Core Banking System]\n    end\n\n    subgraph X[External Trust Boundary]\n        MFA[MFA Provider]\n    end\n\n    User --&gt;|Credentials and MFA approval| App\n    App --&gt;|HTTPS API requests| Gateway\n    Gateway --&gt;|Login request| Auth\n    Gateway --&gt;|Balance query| Balance\n    Gateway --&gt;|Funds transfer request| Transfer\n    Auth --&gt;|Read authentication data| LoginDB\n    Auth --&gt;|Send and verify MFA challenge| MFA\n    Balance --&gt;|Balance request| Core\n    Core --&gt;|Balance response| Balance\n    Balance --&gt;|Balance response| Gateway\n    Transfer --&gt;|Transfer instruction| Core\n    Core --&gt;|Transfer result| Transfer\n    Transfer --&gt;|Transfer response| Gateway\n    Gateway --&gt;|API response| App\n    App --&gt;|Displayed result| User\n\n    Transfer -.-&gt;|Authorized service-to-service call| Core&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="34">
